flowchart TD
    User([Client / UI]) -->|POST multipart<br/>/tenants/TENANT_ID/documents<br/>file + document_type + effective_date| API[documents.upload_document]

    API --> FetchTenant[db.get Tenant<br/>by tenant_id]
    FetchTenant -->|not found| Err404[404 tenant not found]
    FetchTenant -->|found| CheckType{document_type<br/>== base_lease<br/>or amendment?}

    CheckType -->|other| Err400[400 invalid<br/>document_type]
    CheckType -->|base_lease| BaseFlow{Base lease<br/>already uploaded?}
    CheckType -->|amendment| AmendFlow{Count of<br/>amendments >= 7?}

    BaseFlow -->|yes| Err409Base[409 base lease<br/>already uploaded -<br/>delete first]
    BaseFlow -->|no| SetOrderBase[document_order = 0]

    AmendFlow -->|yes| Err409Max[409 max 7<br/>amendments reached]
    AmendFlow -->|no| SetOrderAmend[document_order =<br/>amendment_count + 1]

    SetOrderBase --> ParseDate[Parse effective_date<br/>ISO YYYY-MM-DD]
    SetOrderAmend --> ParseDate
    ParseDate -->|bad format| Err400Date[400 bad date format]
    ParseDate -->|ok or null| WriteDisk[Write file to<br/>uploads/TENANT_ID/<br/>ORDER_filename.pdf]

    WriteDisk --> InsertDoc[Insert Document row<br/>tenant_id, filename,<br/>storage_path, type,<br/>order, effective_date,<br/>ocr_status=pending]

    InsertDoc --> Commit[db.commit]
    Commit --> Serialize[DocumentOut.model_validate]

    Serialize -->|201 Created| Response([{<br/>  id: doc-uuid,<br/>  filename, document_type,<br/>  document_order,<br/>  ocr_status: pending,<br/>  uploaded_at<br/>}])

    style User fill:#2d6cdf,color:#fff
    style Response fill:#2ea043,color:#fff
    style Err404 fill:#dc2626,color:#fff
    style Err400 fill:#dc2626,color:#fff
    style Err400Date fill:#dc2626,color:#fff
    style Err409Base fill:#dc2626,color:#fff
    style Err409Max fill:#dc2626,color:#fff
    style WriteDisk fill:#fbbf24,color:#000
    style Commit fill:#a855f7,color:#fff
